     "caption": "\"Is this a decision or a discussion?\" Ask it first. Save everyone an hour.\n\nTwo different meetings, same invite. One half shows up to decide, the other half shows up to talk it through. Nobody says which one they booked. Everybody leaves convinced the others weren't listening.\n\nHalf of all bad meetings are two meetings happening at once. I flag it so you don't have to.\n\nSwipe → slide 4 is the truth. Slide 5 is me being smug about it.",
