     ],
     "caption": "\"Let's align offline.\" Two people will align. Six will find out later.\n\nThe decision walks out of the call with two people and walks back in as a fact. Everyone else gets it later, phrased as if they had been there. Nodding along to a decision you never saw is now a core skill.\n\nOffline is fine. Offline with no recap is how trust leaks. Whatever gets parked for offline, I write it down with a name next to it. Nobody hears it thirdhand.\n\nEver found out a decision secondhand?",
